@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你这家伙……<br>忽然间跑出来<br>讲什么疯话……！|#0206Trial01_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1,ArmR6,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她说，要灭绝<br>全人类……！？<br>这能做到吗！？|#0206Trial01_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆やや焦り

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1,Sweat1_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……很遗憾，<br>大魔女确实能做到。|#0206Trial01_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed2,Sweat1_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为她的确拥有<br>足以灭绝人类的<br>能力……|#0206Trial01_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:有你这么明事理的人，<br>我就不需多费口舌了，<br>奈叶香。|#0206Trial01_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不用害怕。<br>你姐姐会<br>永远陪着你的。|#0206Trial01_Yuki006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆怒り・威嚇

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed2,Sweat1_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:………！|#0206Trial01_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我已经给予全人类<br>足够长的<link=\"Objection_02_06_01_03\">执行</link>延缓期了。|#0206Trial01_Yuki007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"已经……<br>给你们<link=\"Objection_02_06_01_04\">足够</link>时间了吧？|#0206Trial01_Yuki008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:人类的历史<br>将在今天迎来终结。|#0206Trial01_Yuki009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"是时候把世界<br>归还给<link=\"Objection_02_06_01_05\">自然</link>了。|#0206Trial01_Yuki010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

